@startuml
' New BTW admission and concurrent execution
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web BTW Panel" as UI
participant "BtwRemote" as Remote
participant "BtwCoordinator" as Coord
participant "LiveContextMirror" as Mirror
database "Main Session Log" as Log
participant "BtwTopicRepository" as Repo
participant "Independent Side LLM" as Side
participant "Main ReactLoopAgent" as Main

Main -> Log : commit earlier tool results / events
Main -> Mirror : streaming Assistant chunk 1
Main -> Mirror : streaming Assistant chunk 2
User -> UI : /btw Why this design?
UI -> Remote : ask(sessionId, requestId, question)
Remote -> Coord : authorize + singleflight reservation
note over Coord
  No await before ContextCut capture.
end note
Coord -> Log : snapshot committed events @ seq S
Coord -> Mirror : copy Attempt @ (id, revision, index=2)
Mirror --> Coord : partial Assistant + request facts
Coord -> Coord : freeze ContextCut
Coord -> Repo : persist Topic + Turn(running)
Repo --> Coord : durable receipt
Coord -> Side : detach independent request
Coord --> Remote : receipt(topicId, turnId)
Remote --> UI : admitted
par Primary ReAct continues
  Main -> Mirror : chunk 3 etc.
  Main -> Log : further assistant/tool events
and Side request progresses
  Side --> Coord : BTW text delta
  Coord --> UI : watch(delta)
  Side --> Coord : completion
  Coord -> Repo : persist complete answer
  Repo --> Coord : durable
  Coord --> UI : watch(settled)
end
note over Main,Side
  No primary Inbox mutation,
  no side tool execution.
end note
@enduml
